WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.480
Airport security without surprises. Here is what will happen.

2
00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:12.528
Liquids go in a clear bag, out of the main bag, before we queue.

3
00:00:12.528 --> 00:00:16.728
Laptop and devices go in their own tray.

4
00:00:16.728 --> 00:00:24.672
We tell staff we are autistic, if we want more time or a calmer lane. It is allowed.

5
00:00:24.672 --> 00:00:30.576
We walk through the gate. A beep just means a quick check.

6
00:00:30.576 --> 00:00:38.328
A staff member may pat down our arms or back. We can ask them to explain first.

7
00:00:38.328 --> 00:00:43.032
We collect our things and count them before we walk on.

8
00:00:43.032 --> 00:00:48.264
Then we are through, and we find our gate and sit near it.

9
00:00:48.264 --> 00:00:56.472
All done. Now you know what will happen. You can watch this again any time.

